update public.species set body = $v$A peaceful, charismatic snail that breeds slowly, giving birth to one baby at a time, so it won't overrun a tank. Prefers warm, hard, alkaline water. Generally leaves healthy plants alone but enjoys algae and biofilm. Keep pH at 7.2 or above with GH 8 or more for a healthy shell, and avoid copper medications.$v$ where slug = $v$rabbit-snail$v$;
