update public.species set ph_min = 6.0, min_group_size = 6, body = $v$Grows much larger than common silver dollars, so plan for a big tank and a group of 6 or more. Eats plants readily, so use hardy or artificial decor and feed plenty of greens. Skittish when kept alone or in small tanks.$v$ where slug = $v$red-hook-silver-dollar$v$;
