update public.species set ph_min = 6.0, body = $v$Needs a large tank and grows quarrelsome with its own kind, so it is best kept on its own. Eats plants and nips fins, so choose robust tankmates and no live plants. A powerful jumper that needs a tight, heavy lid.$v$ where slug = $v$banded-leporinus$v$;
