update public.species set ph_min = 7.0, gh_min = 6, body = $v$Eats algae, detritus, and leftover food without harming healthy plants. It is hermaphroditic and breeds fast, so populations explode when food is plentiful. Control numbers by feeding less, or add assassin snails or pea puffers. Keep pH at 7 or above with some hardness (GH 6 or more) so the shell stays smooth and strong, and avoid copper medications, which kill snails.$v$ where slug = $v$bladder-snail$v$;
